{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55340","headline":"山北东林诗 · 修睦","name":"山北东林诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二林乘兴往，几日见归程。\n有翼便归程。\n有翼便飞去，何劳更此生。\n川长云迤逦，溪静月分明。\n果熟僧相待，庭闲鹤自行。\n搘颐柽栉稳，远梦石牀平。\n是院水皆到，无窗书不盈。\n登楼双眼饱，倚桧片心清。\n夜永莲花漏，殿高神运名。\n参空寒峤色，压雨古松声。\n早晚携瓶入，孤吟猨鸟情。\n（见《永乐大典》卷八七八二引《九江府志》。\n二诗皆据《古籍整理出版情况简报》一五六期张忱石先生《〈永乐大典〉续印本印象记》转录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"修睦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}